message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "alepe: Access the open data API of the Legislative Assembly of Pernambuco from Python"
abstract: >-
  A Python client for the open data API of ALEPE, the Legislative Assembly of
  the State of Pernambuco, Brazil. Covers representatives, staff, positions,
  departments, remuneration, contracts, procurement processes and legislative
  propositions, returning typed pandas DataFrames with column names normalised
  from the API's own Portuguese fields. Includes a response cache, retries with
  exponential backoff, and Portuguese aliases for every function.
